{"ref":"BDB, שׁוּעַ","hw":"שׁוּעַ","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּעַ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> father of Judah’s wife, 𝔊 Σαυα, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:2\" href=\"/Genesis.38.2\">Gn 38:2</a> and (after cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּת</span>) v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:12\" href=\"/Genesis.38.12\">12</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.3\">1 Ch 2:3</a>; v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בַּת־שׁוּעַ\" href=\"/BDB,_בַּת־שׁוּעַ\", dir=\"rtl\">בַּת־שׁוּע</a> p. 124 supr., and cf. on meaning <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֲבִישׁוּעַ\" href=\"/BDB,_אֲבִישׁוּעַ\", dir=\"rtl\">(אֲבִי)שׁוּעַ</a> p. 4, <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֱלִישׁוּעַ\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱלִישׁוּעַ\", dir=\"rtl\">(אֱלִי)שׁוּעַ</a> p. 46.","next":"BDB, שׁוּעַ²","prev":"BDB, שׁוֹעַ"}